    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "TokenReview dependency errors/s",
      "description": "Passthrough authentication attempts that neither accepted nor rejected the token because the TokenReview call itself failed. This is the API server being unreachable or refusing the proxy's own credentials, and it fails requests that would otherwise have succeeded. Healthy is a flat zero; reads 0, not 'No data'.",
